          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sedekiya mwenye jwa ku Yuda, ŵamtumile Pasha mwanace jwa Malikiya, kwisa soni Sefaniya mwanace jwa Maaseya, ni kwasalila kuti, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.21.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.21.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 21:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Mjawule kwa Yelemiya ni mkaŵende kuti aŵecete kwa AMBUJE",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.21.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.21.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " m'malo mwetu, ligongo lyakuti Nebukadinesa mwenye jwa ku Babiloniya akusosa kuti amenyane ngondo ni uwe. Mwine mwakwe AMBUJE komboleka kututendela yakusimonjesya, kuti Nebukadinesa atyoce kumangwetu kuno.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.21.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.21.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
